    "is_amended": false,
    "addendum_content_raw": "\n In Section VII(A)(1) the Marriott Vacation Club membership does not earn income.  The membership was purchased on 7/1/2014 for $17,431.00.\nFor the La. Ee Deferred Comp. Plan entry in Section VII(A)(4), the prior fund (LifePath Index 2035 Fund J) was discontinued in May 2020.  The investments in\n the discontinued fund were automatically transferred to the LifePath Index 2035 L fund.\nFor the La. Ee Deferred Comp. Plan entries in Section VII(A)(4)-(6) the investments reported a change in the market value of the assets but not income according\n to the instructions. [Filers should not disclose as income any increase or decrease in the value of their account resulting solely from the change in market value of\n assets, even though these values are commonly highlighted in reports to investors.] ",
    "addendum_redacted": false,
    "has_been_extracted": true
  },
